'''Great Angel Chibinel''' (大天使チビネル, ''Daitenshi Chibineru'', '''Archangel Chibinel''') is an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]]/[[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]] variant of [[Cruel Angel Clionel]]'s kids that appears in [[Legend Stages]] and [[Cats of the Cosmos]]'s [[Zombie Outbreaks]]. He was added in [[Version 11.8 Update|Version 11.8]].

