==Enemy==
This enemy works somewhat like an Angel/Colossus variant of [[Tackey]]. Like [[J.J. Jackrabbit]], Great Angel Chibinel's first appearance is at 200% strength magnification, giving him the same damage as Tackey but roughly 2.7x as much health. His attack doesn't reach as far as Tackey's but hits much closer to where it triggers, making it more difficult to enter his blind spot - especially when he has a 100% chance to slow and weaken all units hit for 3 seconds.

==Strategy==
Chibinel isn't very difficult with his low DPS, but can easily become annoying when factoring in the debuffs. Generally, he can be rushed down from his massive blind spot with melee units such as [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]]. Otherwise, snipers like [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]], [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] and [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Storm Beast Naala]] can be used to chip him down from afar, taking him out relatively quickly. [[:Category:Colossus Slayer Cats|Colossus Slayers]] such as [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Awakened Doron]] and Awakened Naala can make use of their 1.6x damage multiplier to bring him down even faster.

