==Trivia==
*The name Chibinel is a portmanteau of ちび ''chibi'', meaning "small" or "little", and ''[[Cruel Angel Clionel|Clionel]]''.
*Great Angel Chibinel, [[Heavenly Le'saint]] and [[Archangel Exiel]] all have the word 大天使 ''daitenshi'' (archangel; lit. "great angel") in their Japanese names.
**Heavenly Le'saint is the only one who isn't a [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]].
**Interestingly, Cruel Angel Clionel's Japanese title is 断罪天使 ''Danzai Tenshi'' ("Condemnation Angel"), not 大天使; it's unclear whether this is simply a title or a separate classification from archangels.
*He is the only variant of [[Cli-One]] whose Japanese name does not contain クオリネ ''kuorine'', an anagram of クリオネ ''kurione'' ([[wikipedia:Clione|clione]]).
*He is the only Colossus whose Japanese description mentions a "certain laboratory" (とある研究所) rather than an "[[Laboratory of Relics|ancient laboratory]]" (古代研究所).
*He is the only enemy in a Colossus [[Gauntlet]] to not get incrementally buffed, appearing at 100% in [[Attack of the Omens/Three Omens Lv.1~20|Three Omens Lv.1~10]].

